  "name": "Upload a video once and auto-post it to TikTok, Instagram Reels and YouTube Shorts",
  "tags": [],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "4145978f-f857-4bad-9ae3-295d152f5f01",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -700,
        -260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 560,
        "height": 940,
        "content": "## One upload form for TikTok, Reels and Shorts\nShare one link with your team or clients: they upload a vertical video and pick the networks. PostWire writes a caption for each network, the uploader reviews and edits them on the next page, and the video is posted now or added to your next free queue slot. The last page shows the links.\n\n### How it works\n1. **Upload form** (n8n Form) takes the video, a short description, the networks and when to post.\n2. **Host the video** (PostWire, Media \u2192 Upload) gives it a public link the networks can download; up to 1 GB.\n3. **Write a caption for each network** (PostWire, Write Drafts) drafts native captions plus a YouTube title.\n4. **Review the captions** shows the drafts in editable boxes; **Cancel?** ends the run if the uploader cancels.\n5. **Use my edits** keeps what they changed. **Now or later?** routes to **Publish now** or **Add to my queue**.\n6. **Collect the results** and **Log it** save one row per upload in Google Sheets; **Show the links** ends the form with each link or the fix.\n\n### Setup\n1. Install the verified **PostWire** node (search \"PostWire\" in the nodes panel), create an account at postwire.io, connect your networks (one click each: no developer app, no Meta or TikTok review) and paste your API key into a **PostWire API** credential.\n2. Optional: set weekly queue times per brand in PostWire for \"next free slot\".\n3. Add a Google Sheets credential and a sheet with `date, about, networks, when, result`.\n4. Activate the workflow and share the form's production URL. Use MP4 (H.264), 9:16, 3-90 seconds.\n\nFree PostWire plan: 20 posts a month and 2 networks per post, no card; 3 or more networks per post need a paid plan."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "7a3e2dc7-94bb-4bc8-b393-61fd65a1cade",
      "name": "Upload form",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger",
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "5f0f6d0b-3c57-4a53-9a39-6d0e7b3f2a11",
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "formTitle": "Post a video to TikTok, Reels and Shorts",
        "formFields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "fieldName": "video",
              "fieldType": "file",
              "fieldLabel": "Video",
              "multipleFiles": false,
              "requiredField": true,
              "acceptFileTypes": ".mp4,.mov"
            },
            {
              "fieldName": "about",
              "fieldType": "textarea",
              "fieldLabel": "What is the video about?",
              "placeholder": "Facts, names, a link: the more concrete, the better the captions",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldName": "networks",
              "fieldType": "checkbox",
              "fieldLabel": "Networks",
              "fieldOptions": {
                "values": [
                  {
                    "option": "TikTok"
                  },
                  {
                    "option": "Instagram Reels"
                  },
                  {
                    "option": "YouTube Shorts"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldName": "when",
              "fieldType": "radio",
              "fieldLabel": "When",
              "fieldOptions": {
                "values": [
                  {
                    "option": "Now"
                  },
                  {
                    "option": "Next free slot in my queue"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "requiredField": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "formDescription": "Upload a vertical video. You will review the captions before anything is posted."
      },
      "typeVersion": 2.5
    },
